      "content": "i dont even know why i'm bothering anymore. been on hold for 6 hours just to be told my application was lost because of a 'clerical error' and they cant even reopen it without a new hearing in like 8 months. it feels like the world is just designed to make people like me disappear. like i dont even exist to them. just a number that got deleted.",
